# The playground: a character to walk around, with a follow camera behind it (see docs/physics/design.md#characters).
# W, A, S and D or a gamepad's left stick walk it, Space or the gamepad's A jumps, and the right mouse button or the
# right stick turns the camera. It walks up the stairs, slides along the blue wall, stops below the steep red ramp and
# walks up the gentle gray one, rides the yellow platform, and pushes the green boxes. Positions are raw
# World_Position values in units of 2^-24 m, so 2516582400000000000 is 1.5e11 m. The editor writes this file; see
# docs/editor/document-and-scenes.md#scenes.
